    "description": "The Geotopes Project Group (Swiss Academy of Sciences SCNAT) centralises all geodata relating to cantonal geotope inventories in a GIS database. The aim is to obtain a nationwide overview of geotope inventories at the cantonal level. The map shows the current status of the cantonal geotope inventories. It facilitates access to the information and geodata from the cantonal geotope inventories.",
